---
description: Preserve user Git authorship without Cursor or AI co-author attribution
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git authorship

- Use the repository or user's existing Git author identity.
- Never add a `Co-authored-by` trailer for Cursor, Codex, Claude, an AI assistant, or an agent.
- Never add equivalent AI authorship, generation, or attribution trailers to commits.
- Never change local or global Git identity configuration to manufacture attribution.
- Commit messages describe the change itself without promotional or generated-by wording.
